  "user_request_original": "Design a 22-layer dielectric multilayer filter on a CaF2 (Daimon-20) substrate for normal incidence from air. Use alternating ZnS and MgF2 layers. The stack sequence is: air | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | ZnS | MgF2 | CaF2 (Daimon-20) substrate. Optimize all 22 layer thicknesses to maximize transmittance in the 4.15-4.35 μm and 4.55-4.75 μm bands while minimizing transmittance in the 3.60-4.00 μm and 4.85-5.20 μm bands. No metal layers. Total layer count is fixed at 22 dielectric layers.",
